    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 03 - Follow-ups (every 5 min)\nAsks Supabase what needs a message right now:\n- new risky COD order: alert admin with the customer's confirmation link\n- no answer after `reminder_after_minutes`: one reminder with buttons\n- no answer after `hold_after_minutes`: order goes ON HOLD, admin is told\n\nEach task is marked done in the same database step, so nothing is sent twice.",
